      "title": "START HERE — safe blank workflow",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Start here\n\nEvery focused node is **blank until selected**. Choose only the details you want said; blank fields add no prompt text.\n\nThe base prompt is placed first and the extra prompt last. Both are optional.\n\nOpen a copy or use **Save As** before experimenting. **Do not overwrite** a saved workflow unless replacement is intentional."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [-1310, -550],
      "size": [570, 280],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Selections become workflow-owned copies",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Copied state\n\nA selected phrase is **copied into this workflow** as an editable/removable chip. Flux or Qwen changes affect **future selections** only; copied text is never rewritten.\n\nBuilt-ins are **protected**. Use **Duplicate** to make an editable user choice."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [-520, -550],
      "size": [580, 300],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Combine in a predictable order",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Combine\n\nWire each `prompt_bundle` to the matching named input. Order is base → identity → pose → clothing → environment → camera → lighting → extra.\n\nDedupe keeps the first equivalent phrase. The outputs are positive prompt text, metadata JSON, and future LoRA request JSON."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [260, -550],
      "size": [660, 320],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Preview only — no model files required",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Inspect before wiring into generation\n\nThese previews show the combined positive prompt, bundle metadata, and enabled future **LoRA metadata** requests.\n\nThe prompt builder **does not load** or apply a LoRA, checkpoint, text encoder, sampler, or image model. Empty nodes stay quiet."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
